{"4925600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kitten Wool Cup", "steam_appid": 4925600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A giant ball of yarn. A field full of kittens. One championship.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in the <strong>Kitten Wool Cup</strong>, a fast-paced, physics-driven soccer game where adorable kittens battle it out using an enormous ball of yarn. Dive for spectacular saves, pull off daring tackles, and score unbelievable goals as you fight your way to the top of the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings you one step closer to becoming champion and rewards you with <strong>wool</strong> to spend back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between matches, return to your cat house and use the wool you've earned to unlock furniture, decorations, and cozy upgrades. As you progress through the Kitten Wool Cup, your home grows alongside your team's success, giving you the perfect place to relax before the next big match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing trophies, pulling off last-second goals with friends, or creating the coziest cat house imaginable, the <strong>Kitten Wool Cup</strong> is packed with charm, chaos, and plenty of feline fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in exciting multiplayer soccer matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience physics-driven gameplay built around a <strong>giant ball of yarn</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through the Kitten Wool Cup league and face increasingly skilled opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wool by winning matches and progressing through the championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock furniture and decorations to customize your own cozy cat house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy accessible controls that are easy to learn and fun to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can your team claw its way to the top and lift the Kitten Wool Cup?</strong> 🏆</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A giant ball of yarn. A field full of kittens. One championship.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e3be3509be0256b61e6475a5a1c987d.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in the <strong>Kitten Wool Cup</strong>, a fast-paced, physics-driven soccer game where adorable kittens battle it out using an enormous ball of yarn. Dive for spectacular saves, pull off daring tackles, and score unbelievable goals as you fight your way to the top of the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/d36297a8902f580fe422fbbae586d344.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings you one step closer to becoming champion and rewards you with <strong>wool</strong> to spend back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between matches, return to your cat house and use the wool you've earned to unlock furniture, decorations, and cozy upgrades. As you progress through the Kitten Wool Cup, your home grows alongside your team's success, giving you the perfect place to relax before the next big match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/f47d0b25110d2817659d3e5d8660524c.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing trophies, pulling off last-second goals with friends, or creating the coziest cat house imaginable, the <strong>Kitten Wool Cup</strong> is packed with charm, chaos, and plenty of feline fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.poster.avif?t=1785759413\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.webm?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925600/extras/4e5c5b1324c532b28629150217a16ec9.mp4?t=1785759413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in exciting multiplayer soccer matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience physics-driven gameplay built around a <strong>giant ball of yarn</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through the Kitten Wool Cup league and face increasingly skilled opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wool by winning matches and progressing through the championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock furniture and decorations to customize your own cozy cat house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy accessible controls that are easy to learn and fun to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can your team claw its way to the top and lift the Kitten Wool Cup?</strong> 🏆</p>", "short_description": "Play solo or with friends in chaotic kitten soccer matches where the ball is a giant ball of yarn. Slide, tackle, pounce, and score your way through the Kitten Wool Cup, earn wool after every victory, and decorate your cozy cat house with furniture as you chase championship glory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c